WEBVTT

00:00:00.155 --> 00:00:04.358
This is your home screen. Your name, level and XP are across the top.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:11.399
Four ways to play. The tutorials, Head to Head against tougher and tougher bots, Create Game, and Join Game.

00:00:12.374 --> 00:00:18.305
Click your picture to open the Avatar Gallery. Every critter has a fun fact, and a way to unlock it.

00:00:22.171 --> 00:00:28.123
Everything else is in the menu down the side. Friends shows everyone you have added, and your friend code.

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:33.261
Stats has your daily challenges, and your games, wins and hours at a glance.

00:00:33.922 --> 00:00:37.506
History keeps every match you have played, with the final scores.

00:00:38.151 --> 00:00:42.375
Messages is your chat. Talk one to one, or start a group with your friends.

00:00:43.071 --> 00:00:47.828
Achievements are badges for reaching milestones. Many of them unlock new critters.

00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:52.697
The Leaderboard ranks every player, by XP, by wins, and more.

00:00:53.325 --> 00:00:55.714
A clan is a crew you play the season with.

00:00:56.954 --> 00:00:59.813
The Level Pass pays out rewards as you level up.

00:01:00.806 --> 00:01:04.219
Play every day to grow your streak. Settings are up at the top.
